          across an archipelago of proximate instincts.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">
          Nobody lies awake aching for an increase in their inclusive fitness. We crave status,
          attachment, sex, belonging, and legacy. In the ancestral environment these instincts were
          welded together like bridges between islands: stepping onto the first naturally carried you
          to the next, and the final shore was always a new generation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--text)]">
          Modernity didn’t destroy our desires — it severed the bridges between the islands.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure
