          alt="Illustration titled Generativity is Dismantled: human instincts severed from reproduction. Five islands sit in dark water, once linked in a chain from an origin point. Island 1, mate-preference and status-seeking, severed by virtual status, economic independence and the welfare state. Island 2, pair-bonding and attachment, severed by swipe interfaces, AI companions and commitment drift. Island 3, sexual desire and orgasm drive, severed by pornography, sexual novelty and casual sex. Island 4, belonging and tribal-approval, severed by supernormal tribal approval on social media and curated virtual tribes. Island 5, parental care and nurturing response, severed by the failure of all previous links, opportunity cost and intensive parenting norms — the final island is rarely reached."
