            supernormal digital counterfeits. The ancestral path has been converted into a row of
            disconnected landfalls: a thirsty animal that finds sweet water on the very first island
            has no evolutionary incentive to traverse the rest of the chain.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[color:var(--text)]">
            Generativity collapses not because people suddenly hate children, but because the
            machinery that forced them across the archipelago has been dismantled.
          </p>
        </div>

